                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "恭候多时，三位。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushbyte 11
                           pushstring "多罗"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "妈呀！你不就是……。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "果然是他。"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushbyte 10
                           pushstring "巴蒂"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "你似乎已经等了很久？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "你不是真正的影灵的幻视，对吗？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "说话一针见血，不愧是星际使者。弗雷德能将这件事坦白，真是对汝等信任有加啊。准确的说，吾是影灵的幻视的投影。吾与本体共享一个灵魂，但没有它的力量。吾即影灵，也非影灵。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushbyte 10
                           pushstring "巴蒂"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "你给了我们一些线索，还在这里等我们，想必是有很重要的目的吧？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "....."
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "诚然如此"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "我们现在已经确定，我们的记忆被修改过。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "（似乎饶有兴趣地说）除此之外呢？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "除此之外，是的，重头戏来了。"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "镇静）就是在这里，我的头顶曾经悬浮着巨大而模糊的身影，我们都知道『它是什么』，对么？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "对"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushbyte 11
                           pushstring "多罗"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "对！就是那个大影子！"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "神经大条的多罗……"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "你当年亲自帮助萨伦帝国夺走了它所代表的“希望之光”。而“希望之光”是复活约瑟王的必要道具。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushbyte 10
                           pushstring "巴蒂"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "所以谁能解释一下，现在的【约瑟王】，究竟是什么？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "（似乎笑了）不错……如今汝等已经找到了问题之所在。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "是这样的。"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "所以你在这里，是为了给我们问题的答案？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "也许会让汝等失望。吾只是来提供线索的。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "并没有什么可失望的，有线索就够了！最重要的，难道不是追寻真相的意志吗？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "很好。（似乎满意地微笑了一下）汝等失去了记忆，想必找过【回忆】的途径吧？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushbyte 10
                           pushstring "巴蒂"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "啧，说到这个，还是有点困难啊……"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "等等，这样说下去不会泄密吗？"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "飞翼氏族确实有一个地方，在那里，正确的历史还被以只言片语的形式保存着。汝等想必已经去过了？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "云海藏书？他知道那个地方？"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "我想是的。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "那个地方的建成，与回忆的力量有关，与漂浮于天空中俯视世间的逍遥灵魂有关。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "那是什么？"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "回忆的力量，俯视世间的逍遥灵魂？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushbyte 10
                           pushstring "巴蒂"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "队长，我想我找到答案了！"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "……是的，我似乎也想到了。"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "很好。不过在你们踏上寻找真相的路途之前，我还要帮你们回忆一件事。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "......."
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 400
                           pushstring "小赛尔"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "（感觉很怪，但是仍旧顺坡下了）那么，多谢你了。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "........"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "当年，就在这里，那场战役想必你们还记忆犹新吧？"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
                           pushstring "那是当然。"
                           newarray 1
                           newarray 4
                           pushshort 511
                           pushstring "影灵的幻视"
                           pushbyte 0
                           pushstring "汝等接下来要面对的……是比那场战役有过之而无不及的挑战。那是历史已被湮没在岁月深处的秘密，是黑暗森林之中的微光，是命运残忍之中的救赎。。"
                           newarray 2
                           newarray 1
